## Part IV: Environment Setup

### First Time Setup

```bash
# 1. Check Python version (requires 3.11+)
python --version

# 2. Create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate

# 3. Install dependencies
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# 4. Verify installation
python -m pytest tests/smoke/ -v
# Expected: ===== X passed in <1s =====

# 5. See the system in action
python showcase.py
```

### Quick Session Start

**Restore context in 30 seconds:**

```bash
python scripts/got_utils.py validate                        # Health check
python scripts/got_utils.py task list --status in_progress  # What's active?
ls -t samples/memories/*knowledge-transfer*.md | head -1 | xargs cat  # Recent context
```

### Essential GoT Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `python scripts/got_utils.py dashboard` | Overview |
| `python scripts/got_utils.py task create "Title"` | Create task |
| `python scripts/got_utils.py task start T-XXX` | Start working |
| `python scripts/got_utils.py task complete T-XXX --notes "..."` | Complete |
| `python scripts/got_utils.py sprint status` | Current sprint |

