## Part IX: Algorithm Reference

### When to Use Which Algorithm

| Need | Algorithm | Complexity |
|------|-----------|------------|
| Term importance | PageRank | O(iterations × edges) |
| Document relevance | BM25 | O(query_terms × docs) |
| Concept clusters | Louvain | O(edges) per pass |
| Query expansion | Lateral walk | O(depth × branching) |
| Similarity | Cosine | O(dimensions) |

### O(n²) Warning Signs

- Nested loops over all documents
- All-pairs similarity computation
- Complete co-occurrence matrices without limits

**Mitigation:** Limit neighbors per term (`k=100`)

